    "title": "Proposed Nettleton Public Schools millage increase discussed at special meeting - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Nena Zimmer ,\n7 hours ago Jonesboro, AR – (JonesboroRightNow.com) – Community members and school officials met on Tuesday to discuss the proposed millage increase for Nettleton Public Schools. The millage is in response to the district’s growth and would fund various improvement projects across its campuses. If passed, the 4.8 mill increase will take the total school tax levy to 43.38 mills. The last millage increase was in 2012. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
